<title>CANADA: More than one mln Alberta acres unharvested.</title>
<headline>More than one mln Alberta acres unharvested.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than one million Alberta acres were not harvested due to cold, wet harvest conditions this fall, Alberta Agriculture said.</p>
<p>About three-quarters of the 1,090,080 unharvested acres were located in Alberta's Peace River Valley, preliminary estimates indicated.</p>
<p>TOTAL SNOWED UNDER CROPS IN ALBERTA (acres)</p>
<p>Wheat     307,234</p>
<p>Barley    225,703</p>
<p>Oats	112,564</p>
<p>Canola    191,746</p>
<p>Peas	 52,371</p>
<p>Forage Seed 31,000</p>
<p>Hay	 163,582</p>
<p>Flax	  5,840</p>
<p>Other	    40</p>
<p>Total:  1,090,080</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
